<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Start With the Laundry Flow</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Every load follows the same path: sort, wash, dry, fold or hang, and put away. When your room is set up in that order, with each supply stored at the station where you use it, laundry gets faster and the clutter has nowhere to collect.</p>



